      "source": "<code>parameter</code> - the method parameter to resolve to an argument value\n(pre-nested in case of a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a> declaration)",
